<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<title>Services — Ostrom &amp; Kemp</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kitchens, built-ins, stairs and doors made in our Hudson workshop; sash windows, porches and whole houses restored on site. What each includes, how long it takes and what it usually costs.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Services — Ostrom &amp; Kemp">
<meta property="og:description" content="Kitchens, built-ins, stairs and doors made in our Hudson workshop; sash windows, porches and whole houses restored on site.">
</head>
<body>
{% render 'header' %}
<main>
<section class="bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pt-14 pb-16 md:px-8 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-24" data-reveal>
    <p class="mono text-base-content/70">Services</p>
    <h1 class="mt-6 max-w-5xl text-[clamp(2.75rem,6vw,5.5rem)] font-light">We do a few things, and do them ourselves</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Three are made at our benches on Union Street, three are done in your house. Each begins with a free visit and a measured drawing, and ends with a visit a year later.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Services" class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
      {% for service in data.services %}<a href="#{{ service.id }}" class="mono link-hover text-base-content/80">{{ service.name }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>
{% for service in data.services %}
{% assign side = forloop.index | modulo: 2 %}
<section id="{{ service.id }}" class="scroll-mt-20 border-t border-base-300 bg-base-100 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-16 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 {% if side == 0 %}lg:order-last lg:col-start-8{% endif %}" data-reveal>
      {% if service.image %}<img src="{{ service.image }}" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover">{% else %}<div class="aspect-[4/5] w-full bg-base-200"></div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 {% if side == 0 %}lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-1{% endif %}" data-reveal>
      <p class="mono text-base-content/70">{% if forloop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ forloop.index }} · {% if service.made == "workshop" %}Made in our workshop{% else %}Done in your house{% endif %}</p>
      <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-light md:text-5xl">{{ service.name }}</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">{{ service.summary }}</p>
      {% if service.included.size > 0 %}
      <h3 class="mt-10 text-base-content/70"><span class="mono">What it includes</span></h3>
      <ul class="mt-3 border-t border-base-300">
        {% for line in service.included %}<li class="flex gap-4 border-b border-base-300 py-3"><span class="mono w-6 shrink-0 pt-1 text-base-content/70">{% if forloop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ forloop.index }}</span><span>{{ line }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endif %}
      <dl class="title-block mt-8 bg-base-200 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="p-4"><dt class="mono text-base-content/70">How long it usually takes</dt><dd class="mt-2">{{ service.takes }}</dd></div>
        <div class="p-4"><dt class="mono text-base-content/70">Typical range</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-pretty">{{ service.range }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
      {% assign related = data.projects | where: "kind", service.kind %}
      {% if related.size > 0 %}
      <h3 class="mt-12 text-base-content/70"><span class="mono">Projects of this kind</span></h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        {% for project in related limit: 3 %}
        <li>
          <a href="/work/{{ project.id }}" class="group block">
            {% if project.after %}<img src="{{ project.after }}" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover">{% else %}<div class="aspect-[4/5] w-full bg-base-200"></div>{% endif %}
            <span class="mt-3 block leading-tight underline-offset-4 group-hover:underline">{{ project.title }}</span>
            <span class="mono mt-1 block text-base-content/70">{{ project.town }} · {{ project.finished }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endfor %}
<section class="bg-base-200 text-base-content">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 md:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <p class="mono text-base-content/70">What we don't do</p>
      <h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-light md:text-5xl">And who to call instead</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">We would rather send you to someone good than take on work that is not ours.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="border-t border-base-content/20 lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
      <li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-base-content/20 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
        <span class="text-xl">New houses</span>
        <span class="text-pretty text-base-content/80">Fairview Builders in Ghent build new houses well, and we are glad to make their kitchens.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-base-content/20 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
        <span class="text-xl">Roofs</span>
        <span class="text-pretty text-base-content/80">Callan &amp; Sons in Claverack, for slate, standing seam and the flashing around old chimneys.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-base-content/20 py-6 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] sm:gap-8">
        <span class="text-xl">Jobs under two days</span>
        <span class="text-pretty text-base-content/80">Pete Lowry in Hudson fixes what a house needs fixing on a Tuesday, and answers his phone.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% render 'questions' %}
{% render 'request' %}
</main>
{% render 'footer' %}
</body>
</html>
